# Plan Placement — Three Places Only

PLANS go only in:
  1. `unified-trading-pm/` — permanent, tracked, visible to team (epics, roadmaps, long-term plans)
  2. `unified-trading-pm/plans/ai/` — active AI execution plans, current session only
  3. `unified-trading-pm/plans/cursor-plans/` — Cursor IDE plan files (auto-generated by Plan Mode / CreatePlan tool)

NEVER create plans or execution docs in:
- Workspace root (`unified-trading-system-repos/*.md`)
- Codex root (`unified-trading-codex/*.md`)
- Service repo root or `docs/`
- `unified-trading-pm/scripts/`, `.cursor/rules/`

## Cursor Plans Symlink

- `.cursor/plans/` is a symlink to `unified-trading-pm/plans/cursor-plans/`
- This makes Cursor-generated plans git-tracked and team-shareable
- **Setup:** run `bash unified-trading-pm/scripts/setup-cursor-plans-symlink.sh` (or the copy at `.cursor/workspace-configs/setup-cursor-plans-symlink.sh`)
- If the symlink breaks (e.g., Cursor update recreates `.cursor/plans/` as a real dir), re-run the script

After `unified-trading-pm/plans/ai/` task completes:
- If rollout should be tracked: create entry in `unified-trading-pm`
- If ephemeral (one-session task): delete the plan file
- NEVER create a `*_COMPLETE.md`, `*_SUMMARY.md`, or `*_STATUS.md` alongside it

